        "item_YrceUp": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "column_size": "2",
            "title": "Regenerate Cells.Repair Tissues.Revitalize Your Body.",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "content": "<p>Your heart, like any other muscle, can weaken over time, especially if you are not very physically active. As one ages and becomes less active, the heart chamber that pumps oxygenated blood back out to the body becomes more rigid and less functional, causing inflammation of the heart and quicker degeneration of heart muscle cells.</p><p>Our LifePharm proprietary fertilized egg with Fibroblast Growth Factor 2 in Omega+++ is a signaling protein that regenerates heart muscle cells, stem cells, and the cells that line the blood vessels, while the fish oils help regenerate nerve cells, brain, and retina eye tissues.</p><p>Vitamin K2 then helps to remove calcium from plaques that form in blood vessels so that blood can flow more freely, keeping your blood vessels flexible, delivering more oxygen to your cells throughout the body. Finally, the CoQ10 improves the utilization of oxygen at the cellular level, reduces blood pressure, strengthens cardiac muscles and stabilizes heart membranes. In simpler language, CoQ10 makes your heart stronger, pump more efficiently and beat a little quicker.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
